  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 4.1. Increased capacity of member States to create an enabling environment for entrepreneurship and sustainable enterprises</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Jordan Cooperative Corporation (JCC) launched a national strategy for the cooperative movement that aims to strengthen the role of cooperatives in enhancing decent work and productivity in different sectors. This five-year strategic document for Jordan&apos;s cooperative movement seeks to achieve three main outcomes: a conducive environment for the Jordanian cooperative movement; an efficient service infrastructure for cooperatives and unions; and autonomous, self-reliant cooperatives providing efficient services to members. ILO supported consultations for the development of the strategy together with a national steering committee formed by the Government of Jordan and led by JCC, and provided technical assistance and expertise for the design and drafting of the national strategy.

ILO co-organized the launch event with high-level representation and subsequent consultations to discuss implementation of the strategy with key stakeholders. Following the launch of the national strategy, cthe onsultations to discuss the details of the action plan and mechanisms to implement the strategy were held with relevant stakeholders and constituents.

In parallel, ILO adapted the training tools MyCoop, StartCoop and ThinkCoop to the Jordanian context and organized a training of trainer for the three training modules MyCoop, StartCoop and ThinkCoop for the JCC and other constituents and partner organizations. 23 representatives of these organizations were trained on ThinkCoop and StartCoop, 28 representatives on MyCoop. 
Following the training of trainers process, 27 cooperatives have been trained in ThinkCoop and StartCoop, and 15 farmers were trained on ThinkCoop. 20 cooperatives have received training on MyCoop.</narrative>
   </description>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">4.1.1. Number of member States with a strategy and/or action plan to improve the enabling environment for sustainable enterprises&apos; creation and growth</narrative>
    </title>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
    </period>
   </indicator>
